{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  FEATURED BLOG SECTION - BLOG CONTENT DISPLAY & SLIDESHOW
  =============================================================================
  Dynamic blog content section with multiple layout options and slideshow functionality
  - Supports both grid and slideshow layout modes
  - Configurable background colors and wave effects
  - Responsive height controls for mobile and desktop
  - Blog selection and post limit configuration
  - Optional title image and body text display
  - View all link to blog page
  - Slideshow mode with header overlap and alt logo support
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  DYNAMIC STYLING & COLOR CUSTOMIZATION
  =============================================================================
  CSS styles for background colors, title alignment, and layout positioning
  - color_bg: Custom background color from section settings
  - title_alignment: Controls heading text alignment (left/center/right)
  - shopify-section: Ensures proper section positioning and overflow
  - blog-image-title: Constrains title image width for consistent display
  - Responsive layout adjustments for different alignment options
{% endcomment %}
{% style %}
  {% unless section.settings.color_bg == blank %}
     .section-id-{{ section.id }} {
        background-color: {{ section.settings.color_bg }};
     }
  {% endunless %}
  .shopify-section {
    position: relative;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .section-id-{{ section.id }} h2 {
    margin-top: 50px;
  }

  {% if section.settings.title_alignment == 'center' %}
  .section-id-{{ section.id }} h2 {
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .section-id-{{ section.id }} .section-heading {
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  {% endif %}

  {% if section.settings.title_alignment == 'right' %}
  .section-id-{{ section.id }} .section-heading {
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
  }
  {% endif %}

  .blog-image-title {
    max-width: 250px;
  }

{% endstyle %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  WAVE STYLING INTEGRATION
  =============================================================================
  Optional decorative wave borders for visual interest
  - wave: Wave position setting (none/top/bottom/both)
  - wave-styles: Snippet for rendering wave SVG elements
  - wave_position: Passes wave position to wave-styles snippet
  - section_id: Unique section identifier for styling
  - fill_color: Wave color matches section background color
  - Creates seamless integration between waves and background
{% endcomment %}
{%- if section.settings.wave != "none" -%}
  {%- render 'wave-styles', 
    wave_position: section.settings.wave, 
    section_id: section.id,
    fill_color: section.settings.color_bg -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN FEATURED BLOG CONTAINER
  =============================================================================
  Primary container with dynamic classes and layout options
  - id="section-id-{{ section.id }}": Unique section identifier
  - blog-section: Base section styling class
  - section-id-{{ section.id }}: CSS class for section-specific styling
  - header-overlap-section: Full-width layout for slideshow mode
  - needs-alt-logo: Triggers alternate logo display for dark overlays
  - data-section-type="featured-blog": Identifies section type for JavaScript
  - data-cc-animate: JavaScript animation trigger for entrance effects
{% endcomment %}
<div id="section-id-{{ section.id }}" class="blog-section section-id-{{ section.id }} {% if section.settings.layout == 'slideshow' %}header-overlap-section needs-alt-logo{% endif %}" data-section-type="featured-blog" data-cc-animate>
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    BLOG ASSIGNMENT
    =============================================================================
    Retrieves the selected blog from section settings
    - section.settings.blog: Blog handle from theme editor
    - blogs[section.settings.blog]: Blog object lookup
    - Used for blog URL generation and post access
  {% endcomment %}
  {% assign blog = blogs[section.settings.blog] %}

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SLIDESHOW LAYOUT MODE
    =============================================================================
    Slideshow-specific functionality and styling
    - layout == 'slideshow': Slideshow layout mode setting
    - post_limit: Maximum number of posts to display
    - limit > 7: Constrains slideshow to maximum 7 posts for performance
    - height controls: Fixed height settings for mobile and desktop
    - wide-container: Full-width container for slideshow content
  {% endcomment %}
  {% if section.settings.layout == 'slideshow' %}
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      POST LIMIT VALIDATION
      =============================================================================
      Ensures slideshow doesn't exceed performance limits
      - section.settings.post_limit: Post limit from theme editor
      - limit > 7: Maximum of 7 posts for slideshow performance
      - Prevents excessive DOM elements and improves user experience
    {% endcomment %}
    {% assign limit = section.settings.post_limit %}

    {% if limit > 7 %}
      {% assign limit = 7 %}
    {% endif %}

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      RESPONSIVE HEIGHT STYLES
      =============================================================================
      Dynamic CSS for slideshow height on different screen sizes
      - height == 'fixed': Fixed height mode setting
      - height_mobile: Fixed height for mobile devices (under 768px)
      - height_desktop: Fixed height for desktop devices (768px+)
      - rimage-outer-wrapper: Responsive image container
      - placeholder-image: Fallback image styling
      - Responsive breakpoints: 768px (tablet/desktop)
    {% endcomment %}
    {% style %}
      {%- if section.settings.height == 'fixed' -%}
        #section-id-{{ section.id }} .rimage-outer-wrapper,
        #section-id-{{ section.id }} .placeholder-image {
          height: {{ section.settings.height_mobile }}px;
        }
      {%- endif -%}

      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        {%- if section.settings.height == 'fixed' -%}
          #section-id-{{ section.id }} .rimage-outer-wrapper ,
          #section-id-{{ section.id }} .placeholder-image {
            height: {{ section.settings.height_desktop }}px;
          }
        {%- endif -%}
      }
    {% endstyle %}

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      SLIDESHOW CONTAINER WRAPPER
      =============================================================================
      Conditional container for slideshow content
      - full_width: Boolean setting for full-width vs contained layout
      - wide-container: Contained width layout option
      - half-gutter: Reduced spacing for tighter layout
      - section-spacing: Consistent vertical spacing between sections
      - Only renders when full-width is disabled
    {% endcomment %}
    {%- unless section.settings.full_width -%}<div class="wide-container half-gutter section-spacing">{%- endunless -%}

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      SLIDESHOW BLOG CONTAINER
      =============================================================================
      Main slideshow container with blog content
      - slideshow-blog: Slideshow-specific styling class
      - Contains title, body text, view all link, and blog posts
      - Responsive design with mobile and desktop optimization
    {% endcomment %}
    <div class="slideshow-blog">
      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        TITLE IMAGE DISPLAY
        =============================================================================
        Optional title image above slideshow content
        - title_image: Image picker from theme editor
        - blog-image-title: Constrained width styling for title image
        - image_url: width: 500: Optimized image with 500px width
        - Falls back to text title if no image is provided
      {% endcomment %}
      {% if section.settings.title_image != blank %}
        <h2>
          <img class="blog-image-title" src="{{ section.settings.title_image | image_url: width: 500 }}">
        </h2>
      {% elsif section.settings.title != blank %}
        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          TEXT TITLE DISPLAY
          =============================================================================
          Text-based title when no title image is provided
          - slideshow-blog__title: Title styling class
          - feature-subheader: Consistent heading styling
          - overlay-type: Overlay styling for better visibility
          - data-cc-animate: Animation hook for title appearance
          - data-cc-animate-delay="0.2s": Staggered animation timing
        {% endcomment %}
        <h2 class="slideshow-blog__title feature-subheader overlay-type" data-cc-animate data-cc-animate-delay="0.2s">
          {{ section.settings.title | escape }}
        </h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        BODY TEXT DISPLAY
        =============================================================================
        Optional descriptive text below title
        - body_text: Text input from theme editor
        - Provides additional context for the featured blog section
        - Can include HTML formatting and links
      {% endcomment %}
      {% if section.settings.body_text != blank %}
        <p>{{ section.settings.body_text }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        VIEW ALL LINK
        =============================================================================
        Optional link to the full blog page
        - show_view_all: Boolean setting for link visibility
        - slideshow-blog__view-all: Link styling class
        - feature-subheader: Consistent text styling
        - overlay-type: Overlay styling for better visibility
        - data-cc-animate-click: Animation hook for link interaction
        - data-cc-animate: Animation hook for link appearance
        - data-cc-animate-delay="0.3s": Staggered animation timing
        - blog.url: Link to the selected blog page
        - blogs.general.view_all: Localized "View All" text
      {% endcomment %}
      {% if section.settings.show_view_all != blank %}
        <a data-cc-animate-click class="slideshow-blog__view-all feature-subheader overlay-type"
           href="{{ blog.url }}" data-cc-animate data-cc-animate-delay="0.3s">
          {{ 'blogs.general.view_all' | t }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}

      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        SLIDESHOW CONTAINER WITH NAVIGATION & TRANSITIONS
        =============================================================================
        Main slideshow container with Slick.js integration
        - slideshow: Base slideshow styling class
        - slideshow--navigation-{{ slide_navigation }}: Dynamic navigation styling
        - slick-slider-overlay-dots-desktop: Desktop dot navigation
        - slick-slider-overlay-dots: Mobile dot navigation
        - data-transition: Slide transition effect (zoom/slide/fade)
        - data-cc-animate: Animation hook for slideshow appearance
        - data-autoplay: Boolean for automatic slide rotation
        - data-autoplay-speed: Time between slide changes in seconds
        - data-navigation: Navigation type (dots)
        - data-title-navigation: Enables title-based navigation
      {% endcomment %}
      <div class="slideshow
            slideshow--navigation-{{ section.settings.slide_navigation }}
            slick-slider-overlay-dots-desktop
            slick-slider-overlay-dots"
           data-transition="{{ section.settings.slide_transition }}"
           data-cc-animate="cc-fade-in-zoom-out"
           data-autoplay="{{ section.settings.autoplay }}"
           data-autoplay-speed="{{ section.settings.autoplay_speed }}"
           data-navigation="dots"
           data-title-navigation="true"
      >

        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          BLOG ARTICLES VALIDATION
          =============================================================================
          Checks if blog is selected before rendering slides
          - section.settings.blog: Blog selection from theme editor
          - Prevents rendering empty slideshow when no blog is selected
          - Ensures proper functionality and user experience
        {% endcomment %}
        {% unless section.settings.blog == blank %}

          {% comment %}
            =============================================================================
            BLOG ARTICLES SLIDES LOOP
            =============================================================================
            Iterates through blog articles to create individual slides
            - blog.articles: Array of all articles in selected blog
            - limit: Maximum number of articles to display
            - slide: Individual slide container for each article
            - slide-{{ forloop.index }}: Unique slide identifier
            - height--{{ height }}: Dynamic height class based on settings
            - image-overlay: Overlay styling for content visibility
            - overlay_style_tint: Optional background tint for better text readability
            - block.shopify_attributes: Shopify block attributes for theme editor
          {% endcomment %}
          {% for article in blog.articles limit: limit %}
            <div class="slide slide-{{ forloop.index }} height--{{ section.settings.height }} image-overlay {% if section.settings.overlay_style_tint %}image-overlay--bg-full{% endif %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {% comment %}
                =============================================================================
                ARTICLE FEATURED IMAGE DISPLAY
                =============================================================================
                Featured image for each article slide
                - article.image: Article's featured image from Shopify
                - rimage-outer-wrapper: Responsive image container
                - lazyload--manual: Manual lazy loading for performance
                - fade-in: CSS animation for image appearance
                - fill-viewport: Full viewport height for full-height slides
                - data-bgset: Responsive image source set for different screen sizes
                - data-sizes: Responsive image sizing information
                - data-parent-fit: Image fitting behavior (cover for full container)
              {% endcomment %}
              {% if article.image != blank %}
                <div class="rimage-outer-wrapper lazyload--manual fade-in {% if section.settings.height == 'full' %}fill-viewport{% endif %}"
                    data-bgset="{% render 'bgset', image: article.image %}"
                    data-sizes="auto"
                    data-parent-fit="cover">

                  {% comment %}
                    =============================================================================
                    ADAPTIVE HEIGHT CALCULATION
                    =============================================================================
                    Calculates aspect ratio for adaptive height slides
                    - height == 'adapt': Adaptive height mode setting
                    - aspect_ratio: Uses first article's image aspect ratio or defaults to 2.0
                    - padding-top: Calculates percentage for responsive image sizing
                    - Ensures consistent image proportions across all slides
                  {% endcomment %}
                  {%- if section.settings.height == 'adapt' -%}
                    {%- assign aspect_ratio = blog.articles.first.image.aspect_ratio | default: 2.0 -%}
                    <div class="rimage-wrapper" style="padding-top:{{ 1 | divided_by: aspect_ratio | times: 100 }}%"></div>
                  {%- endif -%}

                  {% comment %}
                    =============================================================================
                    NOSCRIPT IMAGE FALLBACK
                    =============================================================================
                    Fallback image for users with JavaScript disabled
                    - rimage-wrapper: Image container with aspect ratio
                    - padding-top: Calculated aspect ratio for proper sizing
                    - image_url: Direct image URL with dimensions (1024x1024)
                    - alt: Image alt text for accessibility
                    - rimage__image: Image styling class
                  {% endcomment %}
                  <noscript>
                    <div class="rimage-wrapper" style="padding-top:{{ 1 | divided_by: article.image.aspect_ratio | times: 100 }}%">
                      <img src="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 1024, height: 1024 }}" alt="{{ article.image.alt | escape }}" class="rimage__image"/>
                    </div>
                  </noscript>
                </div>
              {% else %}
                {% comment %}
                  =============================================================================
                  PLACEHOLDER IMAGE FOR ARTICLES WITHOUT IMAGES
                  =============================================================================
                  Fallback placeholder when article has no featured image
                  - placeholder-image: Placeholder styling class
                  - placeholder--banner: Banner-style placeholder
                  - dark: Dark placeholder variant for better text visibility
                  - height == 'adapt': Adaptive height styling
                  - padding-top: 50% for square aspect ratio
                  - cycle: Alternates between placeholder images (1, 2)
                  - lifestyle-{{ current }}: Placeholder image naming convention
                  - placeholder_svg_tag: Generates SVG placeholder element
                {% endcomment %}
                <div class="placeholder-image placeholder--banner
                  {% if block.settings.title != blank or block.settings.subheading != blank %}dark{% endif %}"
                  {% if section.settings.height == 'adapt' %}style="padding-top: 50%"{% endif %}
                >
                  {% capture current %}{% cycle 1, 2 %}{% endcapture %}
                  {{ 'lifestyle-' | append: current | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}

              {% comment %}
                =============================================================================
                SLIDE CONTENT OVERLAY
                =============================================================================
                Content overlay positioned over slide background
                - overlay-type overlay: Overlay styling and positioning
                - position--left position--bottom: Bottom-left positioning
                - inner: Inner content wrapper for proper spacing
                - overlay__content: Main content container
                - Contains article title, metadata, and read more button
              {% endcomment %}
              <div class="overlay-type overlay position--left position--bottom">
                <div class="inner">
                  <div>
                    <div class="overlay__content">
                      {% comment %}
                        =============================================================================
                        ARTICLE TITLE DISPLAY
                        =============================================================================
                        Article title as clickable link
                        - line-1: Title styling class
                        - article.title: Article title from Shopify
                        - data-cc-animate-click: Animation hook for link interaction
                        - article.url: Link to full article page
                      {% endcomment %}
                      {%- if article.title != blank -%}
                        <h3 class="line-1">
                          <a data-cc-animate-click href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.title }}</a>
                        </h3>
                      {%- endif -%}

                      {% comment %}
                        =============================================================================
                        ARTICLE METADATA DISPLAY
                        =============================================================================
                        Optional article publication date and author
                        - blog_show_date: Boolean setting for date display
                        - blog_show_author: Boolean setting for author display
                        - feature-subheader: Consistent metadata styling
                        - data-cc-animate: Animation hook for metadata appearance
                        - data-cc-animate-delay="0.2s": Staggered animation timing
                        - published_at: Article publication date
                        - format: 'month_date_year': Date formatting
                        - author: Article author name
                        - Conditional comma separator between date and author
                      {% endcomment %}
                      {% if section.settings.blog_show_date or section.settings.blog_show_author %}
                        <div class="feature-subheader" data-cc-animate data-cc-animate-delay="0.2s">
                          {%- if section.settings.blog_show_date -%}
                            <time datetime="{{ article.published_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}">{{ article.published_at | date: format: 'month_date_year' }}</time>
                          {%- endif -%}

                          {%- if section.settings.blog_show_author -%}
                            {%- if section.settings.blog_show_date -%},&nbsp;{%- endif -%}
                            <span class="author">{{ article.author }}</span>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </div>
                      {% endif %}

                      {% comment %}
                        =============================================================================
                        READ MORE BUTTON
                        =============================================================================
                        Call-to-action button linking to full article
                        - line-3: Button container styling class
                        - button alt hover-grow: Button styling with hover effects
                        - data-cc-animate-click: Animation hook for button interaction
                        - article.url: Link to full article page
                        - blogs.article.read_more: Localized "Read More" text
                      {% endcomment %}
                      <div class="line-3">
                        <a data-cc-animate-click class="button alt hover-grow" href="{{ article.url }}">
                          {{ 'blogs.article.read_more' | t }}
                        </a>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          {% else %}

            {% comment %}
              =============================================================================
              EMPTY BLOG STATE MESSAGE
              =============================================================================
              Message displayed when blog has no articles
              - wide-container: Contained width layout
              - half-gutter: Reduced spacing for tighter layout
              - section-spacing: Consistent vertical spacing
              - align-center: Centers the message for better UX
              - onboarding.blog.empty: Localized "no articles" message
            {% endcomment %}
            <div class="wide-container half-gutter section-spacing">
              <p class="align-center">{{ 'onboarding.blog.empty' | t }}</p>
            </div>

          {% endfor %}

        {% else %}

          {% comment %}
            =============================================================================
            ONBOARDING PLACEHOLDER SLIDES
            =============================================================================
            Default slides when no blog is selected (theme editor preview)
            - Creates 5 placeholder slides for demonstration
            - slide-{{ forloop.index }}: Unique slide identifier
            - height--{{ height }}: Dynamic height class
            - image-overlay: Overlay styling for content visibility
            - overlay_style_tint: Optional background tint
            - placeholder-image: Placeholder styling with dark variant
            - height == 'adapt': Adaptive height styling (50% padding)
            - cycle: Alternates between placeholder images (1, 2)
            - lifestyle-{{ current }}: Placeholder image naming
          {% endcomment %}
          {% for i in (1..5) %}
            <div class="slide slide-{{ forloop.index }} height--{{ section.settings.height }} image-overlay {% if section.settings.overlay_style_tint %}image-overlay--bg-full{% endif %}">

              <div class="placeholder-image placeholder--banner dark"
                   {% if section.settings.height == 'adapt' %}style="padding-top: 50%"{% endif %}
              >
                {% capture current %}{% cycle 1, 2 %}{% endcapture %}
                {{ 'lifestyle-' | append: current | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}
              </div>

              {% comment %}
                =============================================================================
                ONBOARDING OVERLAY CONTENT
                =============================================================================
                Placeholder content for onboarding slides
                - overlay-type overlay: Overlay styling and positioning
                - position--left position--bottom: Bottom-left positioning
                - inner: Inner content wrapper for proper spacing
                - overlay__content: Main content container
                - Contains placeholder title, metadata, and button
              {% endcomment %}
              <div class="overlay-type overlay position--left position--bottom">
                <div class="inner">
                  <div>
                    <div class="overlay__content">
                      {% comment %}
                        =============================================================================
                        ONBOARDING TITLE
                        =============================================================================
                        Placeholder title for onboarding slides
                        - line-1: Title styling class
                        - onboarding.article.title: Localized placeholder title
                        - span instead of link for placeholder functionality
                      {% endcomment %}
                      <h3 class="line-1">
                        <span href="{{ article.url }}">{{ 'onboarding.article.title' | t }}</span>
                      </h3>

                      {% comment %}
                        =============================================================================
                        ONBOARDING METADATA
                        =============================================================================
                        Placeholder metadata for onboarding slides
                        - Same structure as real article metadata
                        - Uses current date for date display
                        - onboarding.article.author: Localized placeholder author
                        - Conditional comma separator between date and author
                      {% endcomment %}
                      {% if section.settings.blog_show_date or section.settings.blog_show_author %}
                        <div class="feature-subheader" data-cc-animate data-cc-animate-delay="0.2s">
                          {%- if section.settings.blog_show_date -%}
                            <time datetime="{{ 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}">
                              {{ 'now' | date: format: 'month_date_year' }}
                            </time>
                          {%- endif -%}

                          {%- if section.settings.blog_show_author -%}
                            {%- if section.settings.blog_show_date -%},&nbsp;{%- endif -%}
                            <span class="author">{{ 'onboarding.article.author' | t }}</span>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </div>
                      {% endif %}

                      {% comment %}
                        =============================================================================
                        ONBOARDING READ MORE BUTTON
                        =============================================================================
                        Placeholder button for onboarding slides
                        - line-3: Button container styling class
                        - button alt hover-grow: Button styling with hover effects
                        - span instead of link for placeholder functionality
                        - blogs.article.read_more: Localized "Read More" text
                      {% endcomment %}
                      <div class="line-3">
                        <span class="button alt hover-grow">
                          {{ 'blogs.article.read_more' | t }}
                        </span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          {% else %}

            {% comment %}
              =============================================================================
              ONBOARDING EMPTY STATE MESSAGE
              =============================================================================
              Message displayed when no blog is selected
              - Same structure as empty blog state
              - onboarding.blog.empty: Localized "no articles" message
            {% endcomment %}
            <div class="wide-container half-gutter section-spacing">
              <p class="align-center">{{ 'onboarding.blog.empty' | t }}</p>
            </div>

          {% endfor %}

        {% endunless %}
      </div>

      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        SLIDESHOW TITLE NAVIGATION
        =============================================================================
        Optional title-based navigation for slideshow
        - limit > 1: Only shows when multiple slides exist
        - overlay-type: Overlay styling for better visibility
        - slideshow-blog__titles: Title navigation container
        - data-cc-animate: Animation hook for navigation appearance
        - cc-fade-in-up: Specific animation effect
        - data-cc-animate-delay="0.3s": Staggered animation timing
      {% endcomment %}
      {% if limit > 1 %}
        <ol class="overlay-type slideshow-blog__titles" data-cc-animate="cc-fade-in-up" data-cc-animate-delay="0.3s">
          {% comment %}
            =============================================================================
            TITLE NAVIGATION FOR REAL BLOG ARTICLES
            =============================================================================
            Navigation list with real article titles
            - section.settings.blog: Blog selection validation
            - blog.articles: Array of all articles in selected blog
            - limit: Maximum number of articles to display
            - slideshow-blog__titles__progress: Progress indicator styling
            - transition-duration: Matches autoplay speed for sync
            - data-go-to-slide: JavaScript hook for slide navigation
            - forloop.index | minus: 1: Zero-based slide index
          {% endcomment %}
          {% unless section.settings.blog == blank %}
            {% for article in blog.articles limit: limit %}
              <li>
                <span class="slideshow-blog__titles__progress" style="transition-duration: {{ section.settings.autoplay_speed }}s"></span>
                <a href="#" data-go-to-slide="{{ forloop.index | minus: 1 }}">
                  {{ article.title }}
                </a>
              </li>
            {% endfor %}
          {% else %}
            {% comment %}
              =============================================================================
              TITLE NAVIGATION FOR ONBOARDING SLIDES
              =============================================================================
              Navigation list with placeholder titles
              - Creates 5 placeholder navigation items
              - Same structure as real article navigation
              - onboarding.article.title: Localized placeholder title
              - forloop.index | minus: 1: Zero-based slide index
            {% endcomment %}
            {% for i in (1..5) %}
              <li>
                <span class="slideshow-blog__titles__progress" style="transition-duration: {{ section.settings.autoplay_speed }}s"></span>
                <a href="#" data-go-to-slide="{{ forloop.index | minus: 1 }}">
                  {{ 'onboarding.article.title' | t }}
                </a>
              </li>
            {% endfor %}
          {% endunless %}
        </ol>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      SLIDESHOW CONTAINER CLOSING
      =============================================================================
      Closes the conditional container wrapper
      - full_width: Boolean setting for full-width vs contained layout
      - Only closes when full-width is disabled
      - Maintains proper HTML structure
    {% endcomment %}
    {%- unless section.settings.full_width -%}</div>{%- endunless -%}

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    CAROUSEL LAYOUT MODE
    =============================================================================
    Alternative layout mode using Swiper.js carousel
    - layout == 'carousel': Carousel layout mode setting
    - carousel-blog: Carousel-specific styling class
    - product-slider: Swiper.js integration class
    - Wide container with section spacing for contained layout
    - Section heading with title, body text, and view all link
    - Swiper container with navigation and pagination
  {% endcomment %}
  {% elsif section.settings.layout == 'carousel' %}

    <div class="carousel-blog product-slider">
      <div class="wide-container half-gutter section-spacing">
        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          CAROUSEL SECTION HEADING
          =============================================================================
          Header section for carousel layout
          - section-heading: Header container styling
          - data-cc-animate: Animation hook for header appearance
          - Conditional display based on title or view all link
          - Title image, text title, or empty div
          - Body text and view all link when enabled
        {% endcomment %}
        {% if section.settings.title != blank or section.settings.show_view_all %}
          <div class="section-heading" data-cc-animate>
            {% comment %}
              =============================================================================
              CAROUSEL TITLE IMAGE
              =============================================================================
              Optional title image for carousel layout
              - title_image: Image picker from theme editor
              - blog-image-title: Constrained width styling
              - image_url: width: 500: Optimized image with 500px width
              - Falls back to text title if no image is provided
            {% endcomment %}
            {% if section.settings.title_image != blank %}
              <img class="blog-image-title" src="{{ section.settings.title_image | image_url: width: 500 }}">
            {% elsif section.settings.title != blank %}
              <h2 class=" h2">{{ section.settings.title | escape }}</h2>
            {% else %}
              <div></div>
            {% endif %}

            {% comment %}
              =============================================================================
              CAROUSEL BODY TEXT
              =============================================================================
              Optional descriptive text for carousel layout
              - body_text: Text input from theme editor
              - Provides additional context for the carousel section
            {% endcomment %}
            {% if section.settings.body_text != blank %}
              <p>{{ section.settings.body_text }}</p>
            {% endif %}

            {% comment %}
              =============================================================================
              CAROUSEL VIEW ALL LINK
              =============================================================================
              Optional link to the full blog page
              - show_view_all: Boolean setting for link visibility
              - view-all-link: Link styling class
              - data-cc-animate-click: Animation hook for link interaction
              - blog.url: Link to the selected blog page
              - blogs.general.view_all: Localized "View All" text
            {% endcomment %}
            {% if section.settings.show_view_all %}
              <a data-cc-animate-click class="view-all-link" href="{{ blog.url }}">
                {{ 'blogs.general.view_all' | t }}
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          SWIPER CAROUSEL CONTAINER
          =============================================================================
          Main carousel container with Swiper.js integration
          - swiper-container: Swiper.js main container class
          - product-list: Product list styling integration
          - data-products-in-view="3": Shows 3 products per view
          - data-first-post-big: Boolean for enlarged first post
          - swiper-wrapper: Swiper.js wrapper for slides
          - data-normheights: Normalizes heights for consistent layout
          - data-normheights-inner: Inner element for height normalization
        {% endcomment %}
        <div class="swiper-container product-list" data-products-in-view="3" data-first-post-big="{{ section.settings.blog_first_post_big }}">

          <div class="swiper-wrapper" data-normheights=".image" data-normheights-inner="img">
            {% comment %}
              =============================================================================
              CAROUSEL BLOG ARTICLES
              =============================================================================
              Real blog articles for carousel display
              - section.settings.blog: Blog selection validation
              - blog.articles: Array of all articles in selected blog
              - post_limit: Maximum number of articles to display
              - swiper-slide: Required class for Swiper.js functionality
              - article-block: Snippet for individual article display
              - show_date: Boolean setting for date display
              - show_author: Boolean setting for author display
              - image_shape: Blog image shape setting from theme
              - blog_excerpt: Blog excerpt setting from theme
            {% endcomment %}
            {% if section.settings.blog != blank %}
              {% for article in blog.articles limit: section.settings.post_limit %}
                <div class="swiper-slide">
                  {% render 'article-block',
                      article: article,
                      show_date: section.settings.blog_show_date,
                      show_author: section.settings.blog_show_author,
                      image_shape: settings.blog_image_shape,
                      blog_excerpt: settings.blog_excerpt
                  %}
                </div>
              {% endfor %}

            {% else %}
              {% comment %}
                =============================================================================
                CAROUSEL ONBOARDING ARTICLES
                =============================================================================
                Placeholder articles for carousel layout (theme editor preview)
                - Creates 8 placeholder articles for demonstration
                - swiper-slide: Required class for Swiper.js functionality
                - article-block third: Article block styling with third width
                - data-loop-index: Loop index for animation timing
                - data-cc-animate: Animation hook for article appearance
                - cc-fade-in-up: Specific animation effect
                - data-cc-animate-delay: Staggered animation timing (0.15s intervals)
              {% endcomment %}
              {% for i in (1..8) %}
                <div class="swiper-slide">
                  <span class="article-block third"
                    data-loop-index="{{ forloop.index }}"
                    data-cc-animate="cc-fade-in-up"
                    data-cc-animate-delay="{{ forloop.index | times: 0.15 }}s">

                    {% comment %}
                      =============================================================================
                      ONBOARDING ARTICLE IMAGE
                      =============================================================================
                      Placeholder image for onboarding articles
                      - article-block__image: Image container styling
                      - cycle: Alternates between placeholder images (1-6)
                      - collection-{{ current }}: Placeholder image naming convention
                      - placeholder_svg_tag: Generates SVG placeholder element
                    {% endcomment %}
                    <div class="article-block__inner">
                      <div class="article-block__image">
                        {% capture current %}{% cycle 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 %}{% endcapture %}
                        {% capture placeholder_svg_name %}collection-{{ current }}{% endcapture %}
                        <div class="placeholder-image">{{ placeholder_svg_name | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>
                      </div>

                      {% comment %}
                        =============================================================================
                        ONBOARDING ARTICLE CONTENT
                        =============================================================================
                        Placeholder content for onboarding articles
                        - article-block__content: Content container styling
                        - article-block__title: Title styling with left alignment
                        - onboarding.article.title: Localized placeholder title
                        - article-block__excerpt: Excerpt container with RTE styling
                        - truncate: 150: Limits excerpt to 150 characters
                        - onboarding.article.excerpt: Localized placeholder excerpt
                      {% endcomment %}
                      <div class="article-block__content">
                        <h3 class="article-block__title align-left">{{ 'onboarding.article.title' | t }}</h3>

                        <div class="article-block__excerpt rte">
                          <p>{{ 'onboarding.article.excerpt' | t | truncate: 150 }}</p>
                        </div>

                        {% comment %}
                          =============================================================================
                          ONBOARDING ARTICLE METADATA
                          =============================================================================
                          Placeholder metadata for onboarding articles
                          - Same structure as real article metadata
                          - Uses current date for date display
                          - onboarding.article.author: Localized placeholder author
                          - Conditional comma separator between date and author
                          - feature-subheader: Consistent metadata styling
                        {% endcomment %}
                        {% if section.settings.blog_show_date or section.settings.blog_show_author %}
                          <div class="article-block__meta">
                            {%- if section.settings.blog_show_date -%}
                              <time datetime="{{ 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}" class="feature-subheader">
                                {{ 'now' | date: format: 'month_date_year' }}{%- if section.settings.blog_show_author -%},&nbsp;{%- endif -%}
                              </time>
                            {%- endif -%}
                            {%- if section.settings.blog_show_author -%}
                              <span class="author feature-subheader">{{ 'onboarding.article.author' | t }}</span>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </div>
                        {% endif %}
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </span>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          {% comment %}
            =============================================================================
            SWIPER CAROUSEL NAVIGATION
            =============================================================================
            Navigation controls for carousel functionality
            - swiper-scrollbar: Horizontal scrollbar for carousel
            - swiper-button-prev: Previous slide button
            - swiper-button-next: Next slide button
            - aria-label: Accessibility labels for screen readers
            - general.accessibility_labels.previous: Localized previous button text
            - general.accessibility_labels.next: Localized next button text
            - svg-chevron-left: Left chevron icon for previous button
            - svg-chevron-right: Right chevron icon for next button
          {% endcomment %}
          <div class="swiper-scrollbar"></div>
          <a href="#" class="swiper-button-prev" aria-label="{{ 'general.accessibility_labels.previous' | t | escape }}">{% render 'svg-chevron-left' %}</a>
          <a href="#" class="swiper-button-next" aria-label="{{ 'general.accessibility_labels.next' | t | escape }}">{% render 'svg-chevron-right' %}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  FEATURED BLOG SECTION SCHEMA - CONFIGURATION & CUSTOMIZATION
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for featured blog section customization
  - name: Section name displayed in theme editor
  - class: CSS class for section-specific styling
  - settings: Configurable options for merchants
  - Layout options: slideshow, carousel
  - Slideshow settings: height, autoplay, transitions
  - Carousel settings: first post sizing, navigation
  - Content settings: title, body text, blog selection
  - Display settings: date, author, view all link
  - Styling options: background color, wave effects, title alignment
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SCHEMA BASIC CONFIGURATION
    =============================================================================
    Core section configuration for theme editor
    - name: Display name in theme editor sidebar
    - class: CSS class for section-specific styling
  {% endcomment %}
  "name": "Blog posts",
  "class": "section-featured-blog",

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SECTION SETTINGS - MERCHANT CUSTOMIZATION
    =============================================================================
    Configurable options available to merchants in theme editor
    - All settings are optional and can be customized
    - Organized into logical groups for better usability
    - Provides comprehensive control over section appearance and behavior
  {% endcomment %}
  "settings": [
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      BASIC CONTENT SETTINGS
      =============================================================================
      Core content configuration options
      - title: Main heading text for the section
      - title_image: Optional image to replace text title
      - blog: Blog selection for content display
      - title_alignment: Text alignment for section heading
      - body_text: Additional descriptive text
      - show_view_all: Toggle for blog page link
      - blog_show_author: Toggle for author display
      - blog_show_date: Toggle for publication date display
    {% endcomment %}
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Blog posts"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "title_image",
      "label": "Heading Image",
      "info": "This overwrites a text title"
    },
    {
      "type": "blog",
      "id": "blog",
      "label": "Blog"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "title_alignment",
      "label": "Heading Alignment",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "left",
          "label": "Left"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "Center"
        },
        {
          "value": "right",
          "label": "right"
        }
      ],
      "default": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "body_text",
      "label": "Body Text"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "post_limit",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 12,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "Posts",
      "default": 3,
      "info": "The slideshow will only show a maximum of 7 posts"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_view_all",
      "label": "Show 'View all' link",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "blog_show_author",
      "label": "Show author",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "blog_show_date",
      "label": "Show date",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "Layout",
      "default": "slideshow",
      "options": [
        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          LAYOUT OPTIONS
          =============================================================================
          Available layout modes for the section
          - carousel: Swiper.js-powered horizontal scrolling
          - slideshow: Slick.js-powered slideshow with transitions
        {% endcomment %}
        {
          "value": "carousel",
          "label": "Carousel"
        },
        {
          "value": "slideshow",
          "label": "Slideshow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Carousel settings"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "blog_first_post_big",
      "label": "Enlarge first blog post",
      "info": "If selected, the 'Image shape' settings will be ignored",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Slideshow settings"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "id": "height",
      "label": "Slide height",
      "options": [
        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          HEIGHT OPTIONS
          =============================================================================
          Available height modes for slideshow slides
          - full: Full screen height for immersive experience
          - fixed: Custom height with mobile/desktop controls
        {% endcomment %}
        {
          "value": "full",
          "label": "Full screen"
        },
        {
          "value": "fixed",
          "label": "Fixed height"
        }
      ],
      "default": "full"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "height_desktop",
      "min": 600,
      "max": 1000,
      "step": 20,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Desktop fixed height",
      "default": 700
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "height_mobile",
      "min": 360,
      "max": 1000,
      "step": 20,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Mobile fixed height",
      "default": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "full_width",
      "type": "checkbox",
      "label": "Full page width",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "overlay_style_tint",
      "type": "checkbox",
      "label": "Show overlay tint",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "autoplay",
      "type": "checkbox",
      "label": "Auto-rotate slides",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "autoplay_speed",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "s",
      "label": "Change slides every",
      "default": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "slide_transition",
      "label": "Transition",
      "options": [
        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          TRANSITION OPTIONS
          =============================================================================
          Available slide transition effects
          - zoom: Zoom transition for dynamic effect
          - slide: Horizontal slide transition
          - fade: Fade transition for smooth effect
        {% endcomment %}
        {
          "value": "zoom",
          "label": "Zoom"
        },
        {
          "value": "slide",
          "label": "Slide"
        },
        {
          "value": "fade",
          "label": "Fade"
        }
      ],
      "default": "slide"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "wave",
      "label": "Wave",
      "options": [
        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          WAVE OPTIONS
          =============================================================================
          Available wave border positions
          - none: No wave borders
          - top: Wave border at top of section
          - bottom: Wave border at bottom of section
          - both: Wave borders at top and bottom
        {% endcomment %}
        {
          "value": "none",
          "label": "None"
        },
        {
          "value": "top",
          "label": "Top"
        },
        {
          "value": "bottom",
          "label": "Bottom"
        },
        {
          "value": "both",
          "label": "Both"
        }
      ],
      "default": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "color_bg",
      "type": "color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    }
  ],

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SECTION PRESETS - DEFAULT CONFIGURATION
    =============================================================================
    Default section configuration for easy addition to pages
    - name: "Blog posts": Display name when adding section to page
    - Provides starting point for merchants to customize
    - All settings start with default values
  {% endcomment %}
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Blog posts",
      "settings": {
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
